{{define "GET /b List()"}}{{end}}
-- server.go --
package server
-- want/error.txt --
TemplateRoutePaths method name collision: templates "GET /a list()" and "GET /b List()" both produce method "List"; rename one receiver method so the exported names differ by more than the case of the first letter, leading underscores, or characters that drop out
index.gohtml:1:11: "GET /a list()" is defined here
index.gohtml:2:11: "GET /b List()" is defined here
